quests
QUESTS

List your current quests and also share them with other players
or abandon them to start over. Also allows you to keep your quests
list output short by ignoring quests that aren't important to you
at the moment.

Syntax: quests [#<param>]

Optional Params:
    abandon <quest id>             - abandon an accepted quest
    ignore <quest id>              - "ignore" a quest (hide from list)
    ignored                        - show list of quests you have which are ignored
    info <quest id>                - show detailed information about a quest you have
    list                           - shows a list that includes all quests in the game
    remember <quest id>            - "remember" a quest (restore to list)
    share <player name> <quest id> - share the quest with another player

